    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>ALG2_U02_L06_Q06</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U02_L06_Q06</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Support-only application; no new primary MLA standard</p><p>If C(x) models cost, what does C(0) usually represent?</p>]]></text>
