    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U02_L06_Q17</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Support-only application; no new primary MLA standard</p><p>What does an increasing interval tell you in a model?</p>]]></text>
