      <text>ALG2_U02_L06_Q18</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U02_L06_Q18</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Support-only application; no new primary MLA standard</p><p>A polynomial temperature model has a local minimum. What does that feature represent?</p>]]></text>
