    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ALG2_U02_L06_Q20</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> Support-only application; no new primary MLA standard</p><p>If a polynomial model has zeros at 1 and 9, what interval might represent positive output between zeros?</p>]]></text>
